<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ reports NZ$122.5 mln trade deficit in July.</title>
<headline>NZ reports NZ$122.5 mln trade deficit in July.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Monday released the following provisional statistics for New Zealand external merchandise trade for July.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>		July 1996	 June 1996		July 1995</p>
<p>Balance     -NZ$122.5 million   +$28.3 million (+$23.6)  -$203.8 million</p>
<p>Exports     $1.82 billion   $1.67 bln		 $1.59 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $1.94 billion   $1.64 bln ($1.65)     $1.79 bln</p>
<p>Figures are rounded.  </p>
<p>		Yr-to-July 1996  Yr-to-June 1996 Yr-to-July 1995</p>
<p>Balance     -NZ$552.4 million   -$633.8 million (-$642.3) -$402.1 million</p>
<p>Exports     $20.95 bln	 $20.72 bln		$20.93 bln</p>
<p>Imports     $21.50 bln	 $21.35 bln ($21.36)   $21.33 bln</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
